# xAI's plan usage, in its usage panel.

## Setup: how to find each value the provider reads. Setting names,
## environment variables, URLs, cookie and header names, and the
## service's own menu paths stay as written.

usage-xai-setting-api-key = A Management API key from https://console.x.ai under Settings > Management Keys, with billing read access. Inference API keys are not accepted.
usage-xai-setting-team-id = The xAI team ID to bill against, shown in the xAI Console URL and team settings. The Management key must belong to this team.
